 Commission  to  serve  the  United  States,  as  well  as  non-  U.  S.-  licensed  satellite  systems  for  which  the  Commission  reserved  spectrum  to  serve  the  United  States.  Specifically,  ICO  is  a  United  Kingdom-  authorized  system  operator 
